{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cascade",
    "steam_appid": 3546500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cascade is a game which has interactive simulated fluids and landscapes you can modify while on a mission or in the level editor. Use aircraft, boats, wheeled vehicles, horses, snowmobiles, Choose a creative mode or an mission driven path with challenges that include drones, turrets, monsters, bases to attack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are single player missions that involve first person characters, horse back, aircraft, driving, boats and more. these involve\u00a0 challenges of exploration, quests, attack, divert rivers etc, fun !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level editor allows you to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify landscapes and the fluids will update in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add simulated fluid sources that will follow the landscape. (water, Lava, mud, mercury, and more.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add large volumes of liquids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the landscape auto material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint trees and grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place objects that interact with the fluids - rocks, buildings, bridges, floatable objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place enemies like drones, turrets, monsters etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your creation on foot, on horseback, in an aircraft, wheeled vehicles, boats, submarines, snowmobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create rivers, seas, and also\u00a0 mix different fluids ( water, mud, mercury, lava, honey. goop, and more)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint with fluids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add drains to control the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create dams then burst them or divert the fluid anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import terrain heightmaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import 3d models, .Obj, .GLB, .fbx, etc. move, scale and rotate them. basic animation support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cascade is a game which has interactive simulated fluids and landscapes you can modify while on a mission or in the level editor. Use aircraft, boats, wheeled vehicles, horses, snowmobiles, Choose a creative mode or an mission driven path with challenges that include drones, turrets, monsters, bases to attack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are single player missions that involve first person characters, horse back, aircraft, driving, boats and more. these involve\u00a0 challenges of exploration, quests, attack, divert rivers etc, fun !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level editor allows you to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify landscapes and the fluids will update in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add simulated fluid sources that will follow the landscape. (water, Lava, mud, mercury, and more.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add large volumes of liquids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the landscape auto material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint trees and grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place objects that interact with the fluids - rocks, buildings, bridges, floatable objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place enemies like drones, turrets, monsters etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your creation on foot, on horseback, in an aircraft, wheeled vehicles, boats, submarines, snowmobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create rivers, seas, and also\u00a0 mix different fluids ( water, mud, mercury, lava, honey. goop, and more)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint with fluids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add drains to control the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create dams then burst them or divert the fluid anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import terrain heightmaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import 3d models, .Obj, .GLB, .fbx, etc. move, scale and rotate them. basic animation support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
